Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyDrivingFollow" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :taxi1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :fog1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:taxi1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow taxi vehicle being followed" .

:fog1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to fog creates high rear-end collision risk with the lead vehicle" ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Rear-End Collision Risk caused by limited sight distance and adverse weather conditions (fog) which hinders the detection of lead vehicle braking or state changes.
Severity Score: 0.75